     1	"""Stage A of the clean ladder step (DESIGN.md §8; D400, D401, D408, D409): the step alone, on 44 stored theses, three sends each.
     2	
     3	The run folder is created once and refused if it exists. Each of the three passes has its own model archive, so an identical
     4	request is sent again and never answered from a stored answer. One spending limit covers every request; it stops every worker at
     5	the first refusal of the cap or the first error that is not an answer's own, and a stopped run is not started again. What was
     6	spent is on disk as it happens, in `spend.jsonl`.
