     1	"""Launch one draw of the release comparison (plan §2–§3; D667): checks the versions manifest, creates the draw's own ledger with its guard,
     2	and starts run_fresh.py detached under caffeinate (the Mac must not sleep, D205), with its log and pid beside it.
     3	
     4	    python3 launch_comparison.py <root> <label> new|old <until day> <guard usd>
     5	
     6	`new` runs the clean pipeline (astra-frozen, the comparison limits, the judge to <until day>, three passes); `old` runs poc-v118. Both read
     7	the shared items database and the frozen manifest. A launch is refused when any file of the versions manifest differs.
